  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Pierre Bejjani is the Managing Director and Executive Editor of Profile News Ohio and the Senior Partner of Diversity Advertising Agency. In addition to running the region’s largest Arabic/English newspaper, Profile News Ohio, Pierre actively promotes Middle Eastern culture. He educates the public on the importance of diversity within our local, state, and national communities. He was born in Lebanon and came to Cleveland in 1981, where he pursued a degree in Civil Engineering from Ohio State University. Pierre has long been involved in the region’s..."
